# Route: guide 45 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Dwarf (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to 59, 73
# quests, 3.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Loch Modan, Ironforge, Stormwind City, Redridge Mountains, Duskwood,
# Elwynn Forest, Thousand Needles, Tanaris, Dun Morogh, The Hinterlands):
# Thelsamar -> North Gate Pass -> Grizzlepaw Ridge -> Ironband's Excavation
# Site -> Stonewrought Dam -> Silver Stream Mine -> Stonewrought Dam -> Valley
# of Kings -> Stonewrought Dam -> Ironforge -> near Ironforge -> Stormwind
# City -> near Stormwind -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): A Dark Threat Looms (278; Mo'grosh
# Ogre 18-19, Mo'grosh Enforcer 18-19, Mo'grosh Brute 19-20, Mo'grosh Shaman
# 18-19, Mo'grosh Mystic 19-20, Emogg the Crusher 19); Rise, Obsidion! (3566;
# Lathoric the Black 52, Obsidion 52); Oh Brother... (167; Foreman
# Thistlenettle 20); Collecting Memories (168; Skeletal Miner 17-18, Undead
# Excavator 17-18, Undead Dynamiter 17-18); Save Techbot's Brain! (2922;
# Techbot 26).
#
# Left out: Morganth (249): the route takes them here but cannot finish them
# (the coverage report's missed quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the Deeps
# (971), Mythology of the Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050), The
# Lost Tablets of Will (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the Necklace
# (2204), The Lost Dwarves (2398), Essential Artificials (2924), Essential
# Artificials (2924), The Grand Betrayal (2929), The Grand Betrayal (2929),
# Data Rescue (2930), Data Rescue (2930), Kharan Mighthammer (4341), The Fate
# of the Kingdom (4362), The Restless Dead (96394), The Restless Dead (96394),
# An Ancient Grudge (96395), Important Heirlooms (96403), Important Heirlooms
# (96403), The Treaty of Understanding (98423), Quell The Uprising (387),
# Quell the Uprising (387), The Color of Blood (388), The Color of Blood
# (388), The Stockade Riots (391), The Stockade Riots (391), Underground
# Assault (2040), Underground Assault (2040), Bring the Light (3636), A Green
# Sample (92456), A Green Sample (92456), Power Overwhelming (92489), Power
# Overwhelming (92489), What Comes Around... (386), What Comes Around...
# (386), Songblade Search (95772), Songblade Search (95772), Crime and
# Punishment (377), Crime and Punishment (377), The Crone of the Kraul (1101),
# Gahz'rilla (2770), Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells (2865), Troll
